342733824124580.png/v88r-vF0gk-LMdc6bS4LkVDppsX6BVzACUB79QlAe_U\"/><figcaption>劇中許蘭香／沈嘉蘭（譚松韻飾）與林錦岐（劉學義飾）的感情線及家族冤案即將揭曉。（微博@電視劇蘭香如故）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T06:58:18.364216+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1172,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}